<title>SINGAPORE: Pan Pacific cuts China hotel project stake.</title>
<headline>Pan Pacific cuts China hotel project stake.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pan Pacific Public Company Ltd said on Monday it had halved its stake in a China joint venture company, Kunming Stone Forest Hotel Co Ltd.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it had cut its stake to 30 percent from 60 percent because it had decided to use its resources in the publishing and media industry.</p>
<p>The reduction of its investment in the hospitality project with China's Lunan Tobacco Leaf Recuring Factory, will have no effect on its earnings for the financial period ending March 31 next year, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
